{"id": "EUVD-2026-107236", "enisaUuid": "51bb73ae-8547-3bc5-ba1f-ff0a0e475d5f", "description": "Chamilo LMS from 2.0.0-alpha.4 before 2.0.0-RC.3 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in AiController::openAnswerGrade that allows any authenticated user to obtain AI grading of other students' exam attempts. Attackers can enumerate exeId and questionId values sent to the open_answer_grade endpoint to expose other students' answers through feedback and consume AI quota.", "datePublished": "2026-10-21T12:39:45", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T15:48:42", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/issues/7671", "https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/commit/2861afd4896ff898a950302f2c00f44726fa6f0a", "https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/releases/tag/v2.0.0-RC.3", "https://github.com/chamilo/chamilo-lms/blob/v2.0.0-RC.2/src/CoreBundle/Controller/AiController.php#L525-L703", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/chamilo-lms-2.0.0-alpha.4-before-2.0.0-rc.3-missing-authorization-via-openanswergrade"], "aliases": ["GHSA-f6m7-pgw8-2v88", "CVE-2026-114389"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.27, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "f784530d-cc64-3fb5-8bdb-21e2449875f1", "product": {"name": "chamilo-lms", "vendor": {"name": "Chamilo"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0-alpha.4 <2.0.0-RC.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "3a484b89-1b48-3343-b549-a73306f2f67a", "vendor": {"name": "Chamilo"}}], "isExploited": false}